Package: isoRouting
Title: Diagnostic Engine for Multivariate Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Joël R.", "Pradines", email = "joel.pradines@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a deterministic routing engine for multivariate time series
    anomaly detection. By extracting terminal leaf memberships from Isolation Forests
    (Liu et al., 2008 <doi:10.1109/ICDM.2008.17>), it clusters anomalies using
    scale-free Hamming distances and divisive hierarchical clustering. Includes
    methods to calibrate anomaly thresholds via Hartigan's Dip statistic and Local
    Intrinsic Dimensionality, extract representative medoids, and route streaming
    data into known or novel anomaly archetypes.
